33:["$","p",null,{"className":"max-w-[62ch] pb-7 pr-12 leading-snug text-muted","children":"AI Engineering: Models, pipelines and evaluation, taken from a notebook to a service that holds up in production. Agentic Systems: Tool-using agents with guardrails, memory and clear failure modes, built on Gemini and Claude. Full-Stack Web: Next.js, TypeScript and Postgres. Fast pages, typed APIs and deploys that don't need babysitting. UI/UX: Interfaces designed in Figma and shipped in code, with the details intact. Hardware & IoT: Raspberry Pi and Arduino builds that put voice, sensing and AI into the physical world."}]
